      "message": "Thanks. I actually suggested moving all the three bullet points since I think the README file is a better location for all of it.\n\nThen it\u0027s also somewhat more \"user facing\", and I think it wouldn\u0027t be out of place in the same file. Also note that the user here is an OEM system integrator, and for them the interactions between ART and update_engine may be relevant for troubleshooting, if they have their own postinstall script, etc. And it is afterall a module/platform API, so I don\u0027t think the info is really that \"internal\".\n\nAnyway, it\u0027s bikeshedding - I won\u0027t block on it.",
